<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Apria Healthcare cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Apria Healthcare cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bankers Trust analysts Edmund Driggs and Charles Lynch on Monday cut their rating for Apria Healthcare Group Inc to market perform from buy.</p>
<p>-- Fourth-quarter charges totaling $76 million before taxes &quot;make it difficult to establish revenue and margin run rates for 1996 and, as a result, to confidently estimate results for 1997 and 1998,&quot; they wrote in a report.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the company were off 1/8 to 17-3/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
